| 17-0add-13deg run2 (17wt, bath 13°C) | **354.4** | **0.61** | Coverage gaps, 1 discard |
| 17-0add-12deg run1 (17wt, bath 12°C) | 267.5 | **0.60** | Minor wrinkle, clean |
| 17-0add-22deg run3 (17wt, bath 22°C) | 272.5 | **0.60** | Slight top gap |
